  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">研究開発領域での共同研究等における事業シナジー追求のため</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">非上場株式が新規上場に伴い上場株式に振り替わったため</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
